    "id": "doc-welcome-01",
    "title": "✨ Welcome to Ajaia Doc Editor",
    "content": "<h1>Ajaia&nbsp;Collaborative&nbsp;Document&nbsp;Editor</h1><p>Welcome!&nbsp;This&nbsp;application&nbsp;was&nbsp;crafted&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Swati&nbsp;Jain</strong>&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;<em>AI-Native&nbsp;Full&nbsp;Stack&nbsp;Product&nbsp;Engineer</em>&nbsp;assessment&nbsp;at&nbsp;Ajaia.</p><p></p><h2>🔥&nbsp;What&nbsp;you&nbsp;can&nbsp;test&nbsp;right&nbsp;now:</h2><ul><li><strong>Rich-Text&nbsp;Editing:</strong>&nbsp;Format&nbsp;headings,&nbsp;lists,&nbsp;bold,&nbsp;italics,&nbsp;underline,&nbsp;code&nbsp;blocks,&nbsp;and&nbsp;alignments.</li><li><strong>Autosave&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Status:</strong>&nbsp;Type&nbsp;anywhere&nbsp;and&nbsp;watch&nbsp;the&nbsp;top&nbsp;status&nbsp;badge&nbsp;indicate&nbsp;real-time&nbsp;debounced&nbsp;saving.</li><li><strong>Simulated&nbsp;User&nbsp;Switching:</strong>&nbsp;Use&nbsp;the&nbsp;top-right&nbsp;profile&nbsp;dropdown&nbsp;to&nbsp;switch&nbsp;between&nbsp;<em>Swati&nbsp;Jain</em>,&nbsp;<em>Alex&nbsp;Rivera</em>,&nbsp;and&nbsp;<em>Taylor&nbsp;Kim</em>.</li><li><strong>Document&nbsp;Sharing&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Permissions:</strong>&nbsp;Click&nbsp;<strong>Share</strong>&nbsp;to&nbsp;grant&nbsp;access&nbsp;with&nbsp;<em>Editor</em>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<em>Viewer</em>&nbsp;privileges.&nbsp;Notice&nbsp;read-only&nbsp;mode&nbsp;for&nbsp;viewers!</li><li><strong>File&nbsp;Upload&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;Import:</strong>&nbsp;Import&nbsp;.txt&nbsp;or&nbsp;.md&nbsp;documents&nbsp;into&nbsp;editable&nbsp;drafts&nbsp;or&nbsp;attach&nbsp;files&nbsp;to&nbsp;this&nbsp;document.</li><li><strong>Exporting:</strong>&nbsp;Export&nbsp;documents&nbsp;directly&nbsp;to&nbsp;Markdown&nbsp;or&nbsp;HTML.</li></ul><p></p><blockquote>Built&nbsp;with&nbsp;Next.js&nbsp;16,&nbsp;React&nbsp;19,&nbsp;Tailwind&nbsp;CSS,&nbsp;and&nbsp;a&nbsp;resilient&nbsp;persistence&nbsp;engine.</blockquote>",
