    "id": "doc-sprint-02",
    "title": "🎯 Q4 Engineering Sprint & Milestones",
    "content": "<h2>Q4&nbsp;Engineering&nbsp;Roadmap</h2><p>This&nbsp;document&nbsp;is&nbsp;owned&nbsp;by&nbsp;<strong>Alex&nbsp;Rivera</strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;shared&nbsp;with&nbsp;<strong>Swati&nbsp;Jain</strong>&nbsp;as&nbsp;an&nbsp;<em>Editor</em>.</p><h3>Key&nbsp;Deliverables:</h3><ol><li>Document&nbsp;persistence&nbsp;layer&nbsp;with&nbsp;zero-config&nbsp;fallback.</li><li>Instant&nbsp;simulated&nbsp;auth&nbsp;for&nbsp;smooth&nbsp;reviewer&nbsp;evaluations.</li><li>Granular&nbsp;access&nbsp;controls:&nbsp;Owner,&nbsp;Editor,&nbsp;Viewer.</li><li>Multi-format&nbsp;file&nbsp;upload&nbsp;and&nbsp;text&nbsp;import.</li></ol><p><em>Status:&nbsp;Active&nbsp;sprint&nbsp;in&nbsp;progress.</em></p>",
